# The MolScribe plugin's environment: MolScribe, which reads structures from
# pictures, for its worker (worker.py). Set up only when the plugin is added
# (docs/PLUGINS.md); its trained model is downloaded besides, by Meno
# (manifest.json, `downloads`).
#
# MolScribe installed from its repository at a fixed commit, pinned by the
# archive's hash, with the releases its own requirements name.
#
# Locked for macOS and Windows (manifest.json, `systems`), with hashes, and
# with only what reading a picture loads and what that needs: what serves
# and trains models (OpenNMT-py's server, SmilesPE's training) and torch's
# GPU libraries for Linux are left out (--no-emit-package each; installed
# with --no-deps).
molscribe @ https://github.com/thomas0809/MolScribe/archive/7296a30413eb55436702011efdff78131f66d162.tar.gz
torch
numpy<2
pillow
